sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Player (Client)
    participant UI as Game UI
    participant GC as GameplayController (Client)
    participant SV as Godot Server (Host)
    
    Note over P, GC: FAZA 1: GHOSTING (Local)
    P->>UI: Select "Cow Card"
    UI->>GC: Set SelectedUnit = COW
    P->>GC: Move Mouse over Grid (3, 3)
    GC->>GC: Show Transparent Cow at (3, 3)
    GC->>GC: Show Green Square Highlight
    
    Note over P, SV: FAZA 2 & 3: REQUEST & VALIDATION
    P->>GC: Click Left Mouse
    GC->>SV: RPC: RequestSpawn(Unit: COW, Pos: 3,3)
    
    activate SV
    SV->>SV: Check: Is (3,3) Empty? YES
    SV->>SV: Check: Has 5 Gold? YES
    SV->>SV: Deduct 5 Gold
    SV->>SV: Mark (3,3) as Occupied
    
    Note over SV: FAZA 4: REPLICATION
    SV->>GC: RPC: SpawnUnitOnClient(ID: 101, Type: COW, Pos: 3,3)
    deactivate SV
    
    GC->>GC: Instantiate "Cow.tscn" at (3,3)
    GC->>GC: Play Animation "Idle"
    GC->>GC: Remove Transparent Ghost